          "narration": "Move one: connect the machine. A machine is an Open Terminal connection, a self-hosted computer where the model runs commands. One Docker command starts it. The default image takes about four gigabytes of disk, desktop included."
        },
        {
          "id": "s04",
          "role": "explain",
