          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 15.2,
          "specific": false,
          "hits": [],
          "narration": "Move three: give the model a job. Tell it a test fails in the date parser folder: fix it and run the tests. The fix lands in the Files tab, the tests run in the terminal, and your app opens in the Browser tab."
        },
        {
